    "content": {
      "text": "House of the Dragon is set 172 years before the events of Game of Thrones and chronicles the reign of House Targaryen at the height of its power. When King Viserys I breaks with tradition to name his daughter Rhaenyra his heir, the decision ignites a succession crisis that splits the family — and the realm — into two warring factions. Based on George R.R. Martin's Fire & Blood, the series traces the road to civil war known as the Dance of the Dragons."
    },
